Revision history of the Raku package "WWW::Ollama".

0.0.8  2026-09-30
    - Added System One structured-decision API support via "WWW::Ollama::SystemOne".
    - Added local Ollama decision-model support at /v1/systemone; hosted configuration is explicit.

0.0.7  2026-06-18
    - Using env variables to obtain default models.
        - OLLAMA_DEFAULT_MODEL
        - OLLAMA_DEFAULT_IMAGE_GENERATION_MODEL
        - OLLAMA_DEFAULT_EMBEDDING_MODEL

0.0.6 2026-04-23
    - Proper handling of image generation.